{
  "note": "I3.6 请求状态归并共享用例（语义来源：Android RequestStateTest / RequestState.kt）。op：approvalUiStatus（outcome→状态）、mergeStatus、mergeOutcome、coalesce（同 approvalId 审批 / 同 rpcId 提问归并为一条）、applySnapshot（快照刷新已有卡片）、mergeSnapshot（刷新+补回 history 没有的 pending 卡）、parseSnapshot（GET .../requests 快照解析，空白 id 丢弃）。消息字段名 = Android MobileMessage 属性名，只放用例用到的字段；快照一律是 GET .../requests 的线上真实形状（approvals[].approvalId/status/outcome/toolName/callId、questions[].rpcId/status/questions[]），两端用各自真实解析器（Android parseSessionRequestSnapshot、iOS RequestsSnapshotResponse）。期望消息只写要断言的字段；questionPayloadJsonContains 断言题目内容被保留（各端 JSON 序列化细节不同，不做全串比较）。终态（resolved/cancelled/expired）不得被 pending 回滚。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "approvalUiStatus：outcome 为 null 时是 pending",
      "op": "approvalUiStatus",
      "outcome": null,
      "expectStatus": "pending"
    },
    {
      "name": "approvalUiStatus：空串 outcome 也是 pending",
      "op": "approvalUiStatus",
      "outcome": "",
      "expectStatus": "pending"
    },
    {
      "name": "approvalUiStatus：allowed-once 映射 resolved",
      "op": "approvalUiStatus",
      "outcome": "allowed-once",
      "expectStatus": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "name": "approvalUiStatus：rejected 映射 resolved",
      "op": "approvalUiStatus",
      "outcome": "rejected",
      "expectStatus": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "name": "approvalUiStatus：cancelled 映射 cancelled",
